OL,3,GNEWSAMost supplies restored after
OL,4,Aoutage - water firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost customers affected by a water
OL,7,Foutage have had their supplies
OL,8,Frestored, a water firm has said.
OL,10,FWater supplies were disrupted in
OL,11,FBuckfastleigh, Kingsbridge, Paignton
OL,12,Fand Totnes, in Devon. Some locations
OL,13,Ffirst reported issues on Thursday.
OL,15,FOn Saturday, South West Water said the
OL,16,Fsupply issues were caused by air
OL,17,Fpockets in the network.
OL,19,FOn Sunday, it said the "vast majority"
OL,20,Fof affected customers were connected
OL,21,Fagain.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
